#: effects/flora_eocs.json
msgid "Flora cannot offer another set now. You must have survived the Eclipse, speak to her in person, and not already possess a complete or packed set or have accepted her gift."
msgstr ""

#: effects/flora_eocs.json
msgid "You begin after the Eclipse: the Brand, lost eye and prosthetic arm are already part of your body, and the new era has begun. The Eclipse cannot be entered again. Speak to the Skull Knight and prepare for your first hunt."
