#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You begin before the Eclipse, with both hands and eyes intact, an early true sword, leather-padded armor and a light barbute helm. There is no Brand, cannon or cursed armor at this start. Find a Behelit and face the Eclipse before seeking Flora and the armor. Starting in a world where the Eclipse already happened does not reset that world."
msgstr ""

